         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### General Rules\n\nThe tables of 6 and 7 are next-door neighbors: multiplying by 7 is multiplying by 6 and adding one more copy of the multiplier, 7 × N = 6 × N + N. For example, 7 × 3 = 21 is the same as 6 × 3 + 3 = 21. The equalities go up to 70: 6 × 10 + 10 = 7 × 10.\n\nSelect an equality on the left and then its result on the right. Match every pair to complete the level and move on to the next one!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
